	<window id="14691" title="/c#00F7FF[Card Book Introduction]/c*\n&#xA;1.Right clicking on a card adds it in card book. The card that is already in the book cannot be added in the book again. \n&#xA;2.Pressing [/c#EEFF33Alt+C/c*] opens the card book the view the cards in it. \n&#xA;3.A card book includes /c#EEFF33Card Set/c* and /c#EEFF33Card List/c*. /c#EEFF33Cards Set/c* is displayed in order for easy viewing cards and rewards. /c#EEFF33Card list/c* is displaying all cards for searching the needed card easily.\n&#xA;4.Below the card list is /c#EEFF33the prompt of getting a card /c*and/c#EEFF33 easy instruction of set card/c*.\n&#xA;\n/c#00F7FF[Card Interface Introduction]/c* (Refer to the picture at the right)\n&#xA;1./c#00F7FFCard number/c*: Each card has an unique number for easy search and taxis.\n&#xA;2./c#00F7FFCard name/c*: the name of a card.\n&#xA;3./c#00F7FFStar grade/c*: Star grade tells the card's level, value and the difficulty level to be obtained. /c#EEFF33Star grade colors/c* include /c#EEFF33white/c*,/c#EEFF33 blue/c* and /c#EEFF33golden/c*. Examples: /c#EEFF33...&lt;4 white stars &lt; 5 white stars &lt; 1 blue star &lt; 2 blue stars &lt;...&lt; 5 blue stars &lt; 1 golden star &lt; 2 golden stars &lt;.../c*.\n&#xA;4./c#00F7FFCard title picture/c*: The card title picture is corresponding to its name.\n&#xA;5./c#00F7FFCard color/c*: There are four types of cards with four colors corresponding to them. They are: /c#EEFF33Monster/c*-&gt;/c#EEFF33red/c*, /c#EEFF33Boss/c*-&gt;/c#EEFF33black/c*, /c#EEFF33Scene/c*-&gt;/c#EEFF33green/c*, /c#EEFF33Equipment/c*-&gt;/c#EEFF33white/c*.\n&#xA;6./c#00F7FFCard instruction/c*: The brief introduction to the card.\n&#xA;\n/c#00F7FF[Card Set Interface Introduction]/c*\n&#xA;1.The way to gain rewards: Getting the whole set card. Below are the two ways: /c#EEFF33One of them/c* means one item can be selected from the following items. /c#EEFF33All of them/c* means all the rewards are given to the angels who gathered all the required cards.\n&#xA;2.[/c#EEFF33Exchange/c*] button: As long as you gather the whole set card, you can press the button to get extra reward. If the rewards are optional, you should select one first.\n&#xA;3.Rewards for set card: At the bottom of the set card instruction tells the rewards for gathering the whole set card. But the rewards can be gained only once."/>
